<section class="hero">
  <div class="lightwash" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 900 620">
      <rect width="900" height="620" fill="url(#mash)" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="screen" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" viewBox="0 0 224 340">
        <rect width="224" height="340" fill="url(#mash)" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="nameplate">
      <p class="name-ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar">مروان أيمن شوقي</p>
      <h1 class="name-lat">Marwan<br>Ayman</h1>
      <p
        class="role">Cloud &amp; DevOps engineer. I keep other people's systems boring on purpose.</p>
      <div class="place">
        <span class="ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar">القاهرة، مصر</span>
        <span>Cairo, Egypt</span>
        <span class="coord">30.0444° N, 31.2357° E</span>
        <span>Open to remote</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead">
      <h2>About</h2><span class="rule"></span><span class="ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar">نبذة</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-cols">
      <div>
        <p
          class="lede">I build the unglamorous half of the stack: pipelines that fail loudly and roll back quietly, alerts that wake a human only when a human is actually needed, and infrastructure that lives in files instead of in somebody's memory.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Most of my work has been on-premises — Proxmox, HA Kubernetes, Gitea, Flux — where there's no managed control plane to hide behind and every failure is yours to explain. The AWS and GCP work came afterwards, and the on-prem years are the reason I trust it.</p>
        <p>Currently in Cairo, working with teams anywhere. <em>Read the postmortems before the résumé.</em></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1.1em;">
          <a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="resume-button">View Resume</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stack" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead">
      <h2>Stack</h2><span class="rule"></span><span class="ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar">الأدوات</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bands">
      {{ for group of stack }}
      <div class="band"><div class="b-label">{{ group.name }}</div><ul>{{ for item of group.items }}<li>{{ item }}</li>{{ /for }}</ul></div>
      {{ /for }}
